  "verse_number": 45,
  "text_sanskrit": "अदृष्टपूर्वं हृषितोऽस्मि दृष्ट्वा भयेन च प्रव्यथितं मनो मे । तदेव मे दर्शय देव रूपं प्रसीद देवेश जगन्निवास ॥ ११-४५ ॥",
  "itrans": "adR^iShTapUrva.n hR^iShito.asmi dR^iShTvA bhayena cha pravyathitaM mano me . tadeva me darshaya deva rUpaM prasIda devesha jagannivAsa .. 11-45 ..",
  "translation": "I am rejoiced at having seen what was never seen before and my heart too shakes with fear, the very same form of Thine, O sportful Lord, show unto me; be pleased with me, O God of gods, the support of the universe. (45) \nV. The very same form: the familiar form of Krishna as will be explained in the next verse.",
